      "name": "Editorial Body 1",
      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Marcus didn't believe in Bitcoin. He thought it was a scam, a bubble, or both. His brother-in-law wouldn't shut up about it at Thanksgiving. After three holidays of the same argument, Marcus decided to settle it.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>He went online, found something called a Miner Forge Pro for sixty dollars, and bought one. His plan was simple: let it run for a year, prove nothing happened, and finally win the family argument.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>He plugged it in behind his TV cabinet, connected it to his Wi-Fi, and walked away. No setup. No software. No monitoring. The little device hummed quietly to itself, and Marcus genuinely forgot it was there.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "p4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Months passed. Birthdays came and went. He never checked it. Not once.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
