      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It was early March. Marcus was lying in bed scrolling his phone before the alarm went off. He opened a Bitcoin wallet app he'd installed six months earlier \u2014 the one tied to the little device behind his TV \u2014 and his eyes refused to process the number on the screen.</p>",
