            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>He sat up. He refreshed the screen four times. He checked the date. He walked downstairs in his socks and stared at the little Miner Forge Pro behind the TV, still humming, the same green light blinking the way it always had. And he laughed out loud \u2014 the kind of laugh that's half disbelief and half release.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
